        "secondary_description": "<p></p><p>While standard boutique seating often utilizes generic foams and thin-gauge metals, the Equipro EI-312 is built with industrial-grade materials designed for a 15-20 year life expectancy. The \"Equipro Difference\" lies in our ultra-resistant leatherette, which is formulated to withstand clinical-grade disinfectants without cracking, and our reinforced air-lift pistons that maintain smooth calibration even after years of daily professional adjustments.</p>",
