            "answer": "<p>For the <strong>Medical Spa Technician</strong>, the EI-312 offers a range of motion that is critical during high-precision laser or injectable treatments. The silent air-lift mechanism allows for immediate height adjustments without disrupting the clinical workflow, ensuring the practitioner remains at the optimal focal length for the treatment area.</p>"
