          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Licensed Esthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>The <strong>Licensed Esthetician</strong> will benefit from the adjustable ergonomic backrest, which is specifically designed to mitigate postural tension during intensive facial sessions. By providing consistent lumbar support, the stool reduces the physical fatigue associated with repetitive leaning movements, allowing for sustained focus on client technique.</p>"
          }
        },
